stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Unauthenticated: visitor
  Unauthenticated --> AuthenticatedNoUsername: sign up / log in
  AuthenticatedNoUsername: State B — username = "pending-*"
  AuthenticatedNoUsername --> FullAccess: choose @username (/onboarding/username)
  note right of AuthenticatedNoUsername
    ProtectedRoute forces redirect to
    /onboarding/username; intended
    destination stored and restored
  end note
  FullAccess: State C — valid username
  FullAccess --> OnboardingInterests: optional /onboarding/interests
  OnboardingInterests --> FullAccess: skip or save
  Unauthenticated --> Unauthenticated: protected route → redirect /auth/login
  FullAccess --> Unauthenticated: sign out
